<LegalLayout
  title="Refund Policy — CG Design & Co."
  description="When and how refunds work for CG Design & Co. website projects."
  pageTitle="Refund Policy"
  lastUpdated="7 September 2026"
>
  <p class="fill-in">
    <strong>Before publishing:</strong> the timeframes and conditions below
    are a reasonable starting point, not a confirmed policy — adjust them
    to whatever you're actually willing to offer, then remove this note.
  </p>

  <p>
    This policy sits alongside, and doesn't limit, any consumer guarantee
    or remedy you're entitled to under the Australian Consumer Law.
  </p>

  <h2>Before work begins</h2>
  <p>
    If you change your mind before we've started work on your project, any
    deposit paid is refunded in full.
  </p>

  <h2>Once work is underway</h2>
  <p>
    Once we've started, we charge for the work actually completed. If you
    cancel partway through:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>You'll be charged (or your deposit will cover) the work done up to that point.</li>
    <li>Anything paid beyond that is refunded within <strong>[14 DAYS — CONFIRM]</strong>.</li>
    <li>If the deposit doesn't cover the work completed, we'll invoice you for the difference.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Once a project is finished and paid for</h2>
  <p>
    Because a finished website is custom work built specifically for your
    business, we don't offer refunds once the final payment has been made
    and the site handed over — the same way a tailor-made suit or a custom
    commission isn't returnable once delivered. If something we built
    isn't working as agreed, tell us and we'll fix it at no extra cost.
  </p>

  <h2>Monthly care/hosting plans</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel an ongoing monthly plan at any time; you won't be
    charged again after your next billing date, and we don't offer partial
    refunds for the month already paid.
  </p>

  <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:hello@cgdesignco.com.au">hello@cgdesignco.com.au</a>
    with your name and project details, and we'll get back to you within a
    few working days.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
